<div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
     xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
     xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
     xmlns:i18n="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/i18n"
     i18n:domain="maitux.stability"
     class="alert alert-warning stability-zero-point-notice">

  <!-- 命名空间必须是 http://xml.zope.org/...（写成 xmlns.zope.org 会让 TAL 完全不执行，
       页面把模板源码吐给浏览器 —— 2026-09-30 在 zero_point_link.pt 上踩过）。 -->
  <strong i18n:translate="">Zero Point (baseline) is not defined in this plan.</strong>
  <div class="mb-0" i18n:translate="">
    Without a zero point (Timepoint (Months) = 0) no past sample can be linked as
    the baseline of this plan: add a row with Timepoint (Months) = 0, then use
    Link Existing Sample on the task board.
  </div>
</div>
